hadiths[96]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1290","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne apne nazdeek bharose wale shakhs se, unhon ne Shoaib ke bete Amr se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne apne dada se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne urban ki bai se mana kya. Malik ne kaha ke ye hamare khayal mein, wallahu alam, ye hai ke mard ghulam ya londi khareede ya sawari kiraye par le, phir jis se khareeda ho ya jis se kiraye par liya ho us se kahe ke main tumhein dinar ya dirham ya is se zyada ya kam dunga, is par ke agar maine saman le liya ya jis par maine tum se kiraya liya us par sawaar hua to jo maine tumhein diya wo saman ki qeemat mein se hai ya sawari ke kiraye mein se, aur agar maine saman khareedna ya sawari kiraya lena chhor diya to jo maine tumhein diya tumhare liye batil hai baghair kisi cheez ke. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek hukm hai ke koi harj nahi ke tajir faseeh ghulam ko Habsha ke ghulamon ya aisi jins ke ghulamon se khareede jo us jaisi fasahat mein na hon aur na tijarat aur nafz aur marifat mein. Is mein koi harj nahi ke us se ghulam ko do ghulamon ya ghulamon se maloom muddat tak khareede. Jab ikhtilaf ho aur us ka ikhtilaf zahir ho. Phir agar baaz is ka baaz se milta julta ho yahan tak ke qareeb ho to us se aik ke badle do na lo muddat tak, agarche un ki jinsein mukhtalif hon. Malik ne kaha ke koi harj nahi ke jo is mein se khareeda ho use q abze se pehle beche. Jab apni qeemat us ke ilawa se wasool kare jis se use khareeda tha. Malik ne kaha ke jaiz nahi ke pet wali maan ke pet ke bache ko mustasna kya jae jab wo bechi jae. Kyunke ye dhoka hai. Nahi maloom ke narr hai ya mada ya khubsurat ya badsurat, ya naqis ya mukammal, ya zinda ya murda. Aur ye us ki qeemat ko kam karta hai. Malik ne us mard ke bare mein kaha jo ghulam ya londi ko sau dinar mein muddat tak khareede. Phir bechne wala nadim ho. To khareedne wale se mange ke use das dinar se iqala kare jo use naqd de ya muddat tak, aur us se wo sau dinar muaf kare jo us ke liye hain. Malik ne kaha ke is mein koi harj nahi. Aur agar khareedne wala nadim ho aur bechne wale se mange ke use londi ya ghulam mein iqala kare aur use das dinar zyada de naqd ya us muddat se zyada door muddat tak jis muddat tak us ne ghulam ya londi khareedi thi. To ye jaiz nahi. Aur is ko is liye makrooh samjha kyunke bechne wala goya us se apne sau dinar jo aik saal tak hain is se pehle ke halal hon, londi aur das dinar naqd se beche. Ya saal se zyada door muddat tak. To is mein sone ki bai sone se muddat tak dakhil hui. Malik ne us mard ke bare mein kaha jo mard se londi ko sau dinar mein muddat tak beche phir use us qeemat se zyada se khareede jis se use becha tha us muddat se zyada door muddat tak jis muddat tak use becha tha ke ye durust nahi. Aur is ki tafseer jo is mein se makrooh samjha gaya ke mard londi ko muddat tak beche. Phir use us se zyada door muddat tak khareede. Use tees dinar mein mahine tak beche phir use saath dinar mein saal ya nisf saal tak khareede. To hua ke us ka saman use ba-ainihi laut aaya aur us ke sathi ne use tees dinar mahine tak se saath dinar saal ya nisf saal tak diye. To ye jaiz nahi."
"1291","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab ne kaha ke jo ghulam beche jabke us ka maal ho to us ka maal bechne wale ke liye hai magar ke khareedne wala shart rakhe."
"1292","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Hazm ke bete Amr ke bete Muhammad ke bete Abdullah bin Abi Bakr se riwayat kya ke Usman ke bete Aban aur Ismail ke bete Hisham apne khutbe mein ghulamon ki teen dinon mein uhda ka zikr karte they jab se ghulam ya londi khareedi jae aur saal ki uhda ka. Malik ne kaha ke ghulam ya londi ko teen dinon mein jab se khareede jaein yahan tak ke teen din guzar jaein jo pahunche wo bechne wale se hai, aur saal ki uhda deewangi aur kodh aur bars se hai, phir jab saal guzar jae to bechne wala tamam uhda se bari ho gaya. Malik ne kaha ke jo ghulam ya londi ko wirasat walon ya un ke ilawa se barat ke sath beche to har aib se bari ho gaya aur us par uhda nahi magar ke wo aib ko janta ho aur use chhupaye, phir agar wo aib ko janta ho aur use chhupaye to use barat faida na degi aur ye bai radd ki jaegi, aur hamare nazdeek uhda ghulamon ke siwa nahi."
"1293","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Abdullah ke bete Salim se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar ne apna ghulam aath sau dirham mein becha aur use barat ke sath becha to jis ne use khareeda us ne Abdullah bin Umar se kaha ke ghulam mein beemari hai jo tum ne mere liye naam na li. To un dono ne Affan ke bete Usman se jhagda kya. To mard ne kaha ke us ne mujhe ghulam becha jabke is mein beemari hai jo us ne naam na li. Aur Abdullah ne kaha ke maine use barat ke sath becha. To Affan ke bete Usman ne Abdullah bin Umar par faisla kya ke us ke liye qasam khae ke us ne use ghulam becha hai jabke is mein koi beemari nahi jo wo janta ho, to Abdullah ne qasam khane se inkar kya aur ghulam ko wapas le liya to wo us ke paas tandrust ho gaya to Abdullah ne us ke baad use aik hazaar paanch sau dirham mein becha. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek ijma wala hukm hai ke har wo jo londi khareede aur wo haamila ho jae ya ghulam khareede aur use azad kare aur har muamla jise faut dakhil ho yahan tak ke use lautana mumkin na ho aur gawahi qaim ho ke is mein aib tha us ke paas jis ne use becha tha ya ye bechne wale ke iqrar ya is ke ilawa se maloom ho to ghulam ya londi ki qeemat lagai jae gi jabke is mein wo aib ho jo is mein tha jis din use khareeda tha, to qeemat mein se utna lautaya jaega jitna is ki tandrust qeemat aur is ki us aib wali qeemat ke darmiyan ho. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek ijma wala hukm hai ke us mard ke bare mein jo ghulam khareede phir is mein aib zahir ho jis se use lautae aur khareedne wale ke paas us mein dusra aib paida ho chuka ho ke jab wo aib jo us mein paida hua fasid karne wala ho jaise katna ya kana hona ya is jaisa fasid aibon mein se to jo ghulam khareede wo do nazron mein se behtar ka ikhtiyar rakhta hai, agar chahe ke ghulam ki qeemat mein se us aib ke qadr kam kya jae jo ghulam mein tha jis din use khareeda tha to kam kya jaega, aur agar chahe ke utna ada kare jitna ghulam ko us ke paas aib pahuncha phir ghulam ko lautae to ye us ke liye hai, aur agar ghulam us ke paas mare jis ne use khareeda to ghulam ki qeemat lagai jae gi jabke is mein wo aib ho jo is mein tha jis din use khareeda tha, to dekha jaega ke us ki qeemat kitni hai, phir agar ghulam ki qeemat jis din use khareeda tha baghair aib ke sau dinar ho aur us ki qeemat jis din use khareeda tha jabke is mein aib ho assi dinar ho to khareedne wale se dono qeematon ke darmiyan kam kya jaega, aur qeemat to jis din ghulam khareeda gaya hogi. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek ijma wala hukm hai ke jo londi ko us aib se lautae jo us ne is mein paya ho jabke wo use pahunch chuka ho ke agar wo kunwari ho to us par jo us ki qeemat mein kami hui, aur agar wo saeeba ho to use pahunchne mein us par kuchh nahi kyunke wo us ki zamin tha. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek ijma wala hukm hai ke jo ghulam ya londi ya janwar ko wirasat walon ya un ke ilawa se barat ke sath beche to jo becha us mein har aib se bari ho gaya magar ke wo is mein aib ko janta ho aur use chhupaye, phir agar wo aib ko janta ho aur use chhupaye to use us ki barat faida na degi aur jo becha wo us par radd hoga. Malik ne us londi ke bare mein kaha jo do londiyon se bechi jae phir in dono londiyon mein se aik mein aib paya jae jis se lautayi jae. Unhon ne kaha ke us londi ki qeemat lagai jae jo dono londiyon ki qeemat thi, to dekha jaega ke us ki qeemat kitni hai, phir dono londiyon ki qeemat lagai jae us aib ke baghair jo in dono mein se aik mein paya gaya, in dono ki tandrust salim qeemat lagai jae phir us londi ki qeemat jo dono londiyon se bechi gayi thi in dono par in dono ki qeemat ke qadr taqseem ki jae yahan tak ke in dono mein se har aik par us ka hissa wajeh ho, unchi wali par us ki unchai ke qadr aur dusri par us ke qadr, phir jis mein aib ho use dekha jae aur us hissa ke qadr lautaya jae jo us par wajeh hua ho chahe zyada ho ya thoda, aur dono londiyon ki qeemat to us par hogi jis din in dono ko qabze mein liya. Malik ne us mard ke bare mein kaha jo ghulam khareede aur use badi ujrat ya thodi aamdani par kiraye par de phir is mein aib pae jis se lautae ke use us aib se lautaega aur us ki ujrat aur aamdani us ke liye hogi, aur ye wo hukm hai jis par hamare shehar ki jamaat thi, aur is ki wajah ye hai ke agar mard ghulam khareede aur us ke liye ghar banaye jis ki imarat ki qeemat ghulam ki qeemat se chand guna ho phir is mein aib pae jis se lautae to use lautaega aur ghulam ke liye us par jo us ne us ke liye kya us mein ujrat shumar na ki jaegi, to isi tarah us ki ujrat us ke liye hogi jab use ghair se kiraye par de kyunke wo us ka zamin hai, aur hamare nazdeek hukm yehi hai. Malik ne hamare nazdeek hukm ke bare mein kaha ke jo aik sauda mein ghulam khareede aur un ghulamon mein chori shuda ghulam pae ya un mein se aik ghulam mein aib pae ke jo chori shuda paya gaya ya jis mein aib paya gaya us mein dekha jaega, phir agar wo un ghulamon ka chehra ho ya in mein zyada qeemat wala ya us ke liye khareeda gaya ho aur wo hai jis mein fazl hai jaisa log samajhte hain to wo tamam bai radd hogi, aur agar jo chori shuda paya gaya ya jis mein aib paya gaya un ghulamon mein se thodi cheez mein ho jo un ghulamon ka chehra na ho aur na us ke liye khareeda gaya ho aur na is mein fazl ho jaisa log samajhte hain to jo aib se paya gaya ya chori shuda ba-ainihi lautaya jaega us qeemat ke qadr se jis qeemat se un ghulamon ko khareeda tha."
"1294","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se riwayat kya ke Masud ke bete Utba ke bete Abdullah ke bete Ubaidullah ne unhein khabar di ke Masud ke bete Abdullah bin Masud ne apni biwi Saqafi Zainab se londi khareedi aur us ne us par shart rakhi ke agar tum use bechoge to wo mere liye us qeemat se hai jis se use bechoge, to Masud ke bete Abdullah bin Masud ne is ke bare mein Umar bin Khattab se pucha to Umar bin Khattab ne kaha ke use na chhuo jabke is mein kisi ke liye shart hai."
"1295","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke wo kehte they ke mard londi se sohbat na kare magar aisi londi se ke agar chahe use beche aur agar chahe use bakhshe aur agar chahe use roke aur agar chahe is se jo chahe kare. Malik ne us ke bare mein kaha jo londi ko is shart par khareede ke use na bechega ya na bakhshega ya is jaisi sharton mein se, to khareedne wale ke liye jaiz nahi ke use chhue, aur is ki wajah ye hai ke us ke liye jaiz nahi ke use beche aur na bakhshe, phir jab wo is mein se is ka malik na ho to us ka mukammal malik na hua kyunke us par is mein wo mustasna kya gaya hai jo use ghair ke haath mein malik karta hai, phir jab ye shart dakhil ho to durust na hogi aur makrooh bai hogi."
"1296","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se riwayat kya ke Aamir ke bete Abdullah ne Affan ke bete Usman ko londi tohfe mein di jabke us ka shohar tha, use Basra mein khareeda tha, to Usman ne kaha ke main use na chhuunga yahan tak ke us ka shohar is se juda ho. To Ibn Aamir ne us ke shohar ko razi kya aur wo is se juda ho gaya."
"1297","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Auf ke bete Abdur Rahman ke bete Abu Salma se riwayat kya ke Auf ke bete Abdur Rahman ne londi khareedi aur use shohar wali paya to use lautaya."
"1298","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo khajoor beche jabke us ki waburi ho chuki ho to us ka phal bechne wale ke liye hai magar ke khareedne wala shart rakhe."
"1299","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Umar ke bete Ibn Umar se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne phalon ki bai se mana kya yahan tak ke un ki durusti zahir ho, bechne wale aur khareedne wale ko mana kya."
"1300","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Humaid Taweel se, unhon ne Malik ke bete Anas se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne phalon ki bai se mana kya yahan tak ke surkh hon. To Aap se kaha gaya ke ya Rasulullah surkh hona kya hai. To Aap ne farmaya ke jab surkh hon. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke batao agar Allah phal ko rok le to tum mein se koi apne bhai ka maal kis se lega."
"1301","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Harisa ke bete Abdur Rahman ke bete Muhammad Abu Rijal se, unhon ne apni walida Abdur Rahman ki beti Amra se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne phalon ki bai se mana kya yahan tak ke aafat se najaat paein. Malik ne kaha ke phalon ki bai is se pehle ke un ki durusti zahir ho dhoke ki bai mein se hai."
"1302","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abu Zinad se, unhon ne Sabit ke bete Zaid ke bete Kharija se, unhon ne Sabit ke bete Zaid se riwayat kya ke wo apne phal na bechte they yahan tak ke Surayya tulu ho."
"1303","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se, unhon ne Sabit ke bete Zaid se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ariya wale ko rukhsat di ke use apne andaze se beche."
"1304","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Husain ke bete Dawood se, unhon ne Ahmad ke bete Ibn Abi Ahmad ke azad karda Abu Sufyan se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne araya ki bai mein apne andaze se rukhsat di paanch wasq se kam mein ya paanch wasq mein. Dawood shak karte hain, unhon ne kaha ke paanch wasq ya paanch wasq se kam."
"1305","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Harisa ke bete Abdur Rahman ke bete Muhammad Abu Rijal se, unhon ne apni walida Abdur Rahman ki beti Amra se riwayat kya ke unhon ne unhein kehte suna ke aik mard ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamane mein deewar ka phal khareeda aur is ka ilaj kya aur is mein qaim raha yahan tak ke us ke liye nuqsan zahir hua to us ne deewar wale se manga ke us ke liye kam kare ya use iqala kare to us ne qasam khai ke aisa na karega, to khareedne wale ki maan Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas gayi aur Aap se is ka zikr kya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke us ne qasam khai hai ke bhalai na karega. To deewar wale ne ye suna to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha ke ya Rasulullah ye us ke liye hai."
"1306","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Umar bin Abdul Aziz ne aafat rakhne ka faisla kya. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek hukm is par hai. Malik ne kaha ke wo aafat jo khareedne wale se rakhi jae tihai aur is se upar hai, aur is se kam aafat nahi."
"1307","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman ke bete Abu Rabia se riwayat kya ke Muhammad ke bete Qasim apni deewar ka phal bechte they aur is mein se mustasna karte they."
"1308","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abu Bakr ke bete Abdullah se riwayat kya ke un ke dada Hazm ke bete Amr ke bete Muhammad ne apni deewar ka phal jise Ifraq kaha jata hai chaar hazaar dirham mein becha aur is mein se aath sau dirham ka khajoor mustasna kya."
"1309","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Harisa ke bete Abdur Rahman ke bete Muhammad Abu Rijal se riwayat kya ke un ki walida Abdur Rahman ki beti Amra apne phal bechti thin aur is mein se mustasna kartin. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek ijma wala hukm hai ke mard jab apni deewar ka phal beche to us ke liye hai ke apni deewar ke phal mein se jo us ke aur phal ke tihai ke darmiyan ho mustasna kare, is se aage na badhe, aur jo tihai se kam ho is mein koi harj nahi. Malik ne kaha ke jo mard apni deewar ka phal beche aur apni deewar ke phal mein se khajoor ya khajooron ka phal mustasna kare jinhein wo muntakhab kare aur un ki tadaad naam le to meri rai mein is mein koi harj nahi kyunke deewar wala to apni deewar ke phal mein se koi cheez mustasna karta hai aur ye wo cheez hai jo us ne apni deewar se rok rakhi aur use rok liya aur na becha, aur apni deewar mein se is ke siwa becha."
"1310","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Zaid bin Aslam se, unhon ne Yasar ke bete Ata se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke khajoor khajoor se barabar barabar ho. To Aap se kaha gaya ke aap ka Khaibar par aamil do sa se aik sa leta hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke use mere liye bulao. To wo Aap ke liye bulaya gaya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya ke kya tum aik sa se do sa lete ho. To us ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah wo mujhe jame se umda sa se sa na bechte hain. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya ke jame ko dirhamon se becho phir dirhamon se umda khareedo."
"1311","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Auf ke bete Abdur Rahman ke bete Suhail ke bete Abdul Hameed se, unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab se, unhon ne Khudri ke bete Abi Saeed se aur Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Khaibar par aik mard ko aamil banaya to wo Aap ke paas umda khajoor lekar aaya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya ke kya Khaibar ki tamam khajoor aisi hai. To us ne kaha ke nahi Allah ki qasam ya Rasulullah, hum is mein se aik sa ko do sa se aur do sa ko teen se lete hain. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aisa na karo, jame ko dirhamon se becho phir dirhamon se umda khareedo."
"1312","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yazeed ke bete Abdullah se riwayat kya ke Ayyash ke bete Zaid ne unhein khabar di ke unhon ne Waqqas ke bete Saad bin Abi Waqqas se safed ke badle selt ke bare mein pucha to Saad ne us se kaha ke in dono mein se kaun afzal hai. Unhon ne kaha ke safed. To us ne use is se mana kya. Aur Saad ne kaha ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko khajoor ko taza se khareedne ke bare mein puchte suna to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kya taza kam hoti hai jab khushk ho. To unhon ne kaha ke haan. To is se mana kya."
"1313","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne muzabana se mana kya, aur muzabana phal ki bai hai khajoor se naap kar aur angoor ki bai hai kishmish se naap kar."
"1314","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Husain ke bete Dawood se, unhon ne Ahmad ke bete Ibn Abi Ahmad ke azad karda Abu Sufyan se, unhon ne Khudri ke bete Abi Saeed se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne muzabana aur muhaqala se mana kya, aur muzabana khajoor ke darakhton ke saron mein phal ko khajoor se khareedna hai aur muhaqala zameen ko gandum se kiraye par dena hai."
"1315","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne muzabana aur muhaqala se mana kya, aur muzabana phal ko khajoor se khareedna hai aur muhaqala kheti ko gandum se khareedna aur zameen ko gandum se kiraye par lena hai. Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab ne kaha ke maine Saeed bin Musayyab se zameen ko sone aur chandi se kiraye par lene ke bare mein pucha to unhon ne kaha ke is mein koi harj nahi. Malik ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne muzabana se mana kya aur muzabana ki tafseer hai ke andaze ki har cheez jis ka naap maloom na ho aur na wazan aur na ginti, naam li hui naap ya wazan ya ginti se khareedi jae, aur ye is tarah ke mard us mard se kahe jis ke paas jama kya hua khana ho jis ka gandum ya khajoor ya is jaisa khano mein se naap maloom na ho, ya mard ke paas gandum ya guthli ya chara ya kusum ya kapas ya san ya resham ya is jaisa saman mein se saman ho, in mein se kisi cheez ka naap maloom na ho aur na wazan aur na ginti, to mard us saman wale se kahe ke tumhara ye tamam saman lo ya hukm do jo use naape ya tolo is mein se jo taula jae ya gino is mein se jo gina jae, phir jo itne itne sa ki naap se kam ho, naam lekar jo naam le, ya itne itne ratl ke wazan se ya itni itni ginti se, to jo is mein se kam ho wo mere liye tum par tawaan hai yahan tak ke main tumhein wo naam poora karun, phir jo us naam se zyada ho wo mere liye hai, main is mein se jo kam ho use zamin karta hun is par ke mere liye jo zyada ho. To ye bai nahi lekin khatra aur dhoka aur juwa hai jismein ye dakhil hai kyunke us ne us se koi cheez us cheez se na khareedi jo us ne nikali lekin us ne us ke liye us naap ya wazan ya ginti mein se jo naam liya use zamin kya is par ke us ke liye jo is par zyada ho, phir agar wo saman us naam se kam ho to us ne apne sathi ke maal se jo kam hua baghair qeemat aur baghair khush dili ke atiye se liya, to ye juwe jaisa hai aur jo is jaisi cheezon mein se ho wo is mein dakhil hai. Malik ne kaha ke is mein se ye bhi hai ke mard us mard se kahe jis ke paas kapda ho ke main tumhein tumhare is kapde se itni itni topi ka than zamin karta hun, har than ka andaza itna itna, naam lekar jo naam le, phir jo is mein se kam ho wo mere liye tum par tawaan hai yahan tak ke tumhein poora karun aur jo zyada ho wo mere liye. Ya ke mard mard se kahe ke main tumhein tumhare in kapdon se itne itne qamees zamin karta hun, har qamees ka andaza itna itna, phir jo is mein se kam ho wo mere liye tawaan hai aur jo is par zyada ho wo mere liye. Ya ke mard us mard se kahe jis ke paas gaye ya oonton ki khalein hon ke apni in khalon ko mere dikhaye hue namune par jootiyan kaato. Phir jo sau jodon se kam ho wo mere liye tawaan hai aur jo zyada ho wo mere liye jo maine tumhein zamin kya. Aur is jaisa hai ke mard us mard se kahe jis ke paas ban ke beej hon ke apne in beejon ko nichodo, phir jo itne itne ratl se kam ho wo mere liye hai ke tumhein dunga aur jo zyada ho wo mere liye. To ye tamam aur jo is jaisi cheezon mein se ho ya is se milta julta ho muzabana mein se hai jo durust nahi aur jaiz nahi. Aur isi tarah jab mard us mard se kahe jis ke paas khali ya guthli ya kapas ya san ya chara ya kusum ho ke tum se ye khali itne itne sa se khareedta hun jo is ki khali jaisa khali ho ya ye guthli itne itne sa se jo is ki guthli jaisi guthli ho, aur kusum aur kapas aur san aur chare mein is jaisa. To ye tamam us ki taraf lautta hai jo hum ne muzabana mein se bayan kya."
"1316","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne do Saadon ko hukm diya ke ghanimaton mein se sone ya chandi ke bartan bechein to unhon ne har teen ko chaar naqd se ya har chaar ko teen naqd se becha to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne in dono se farmaya ke tum dono ne sood khaya to lauta do."
"1317","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Tamim ke bete Abi Tamim Musa se, unhon ne Yasar ke bete Abi Habab Saeed se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke dinar dinar se aur dirham dirham se, in dono ke darmiyan koi fazl nahi."
"1318","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Khudri ke bete Abi Saeed se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke sona sone se na becho magar barabar barabar aur baaz ko baaz par zyada na karo, aur chandi ko chandi se na becho magar barabar barabar aur baaz ko baaz par zyada na karo, aur is mein se koi cheez ghaib ko hazir se na becho."
"1319","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Makki Qais ke bete Humaid se, unhon ne Mujahid se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke main Abdullah bin Umar ke sath tha to un ke paas sunar aaya aur un se kaha ke aye Abu Abdur Rahman main sona ghadta hun phir is mein se cheez ko us ke wazan se zyada se bechta hun aur is mein se apne haath ke kaam ke qadr zyada leta hun. To Abdullah ne use is se mana kya to sunar un se sawal dobara karta raha aur Abdullah use mana karte rahe yahan tak ke masjid ke darwaze tak ya sawari tak pahunche jis par sawaar hona chahte they, phir Abdullah bin Umar ne kaha ke dinar dinar se aur dirham dirham se, in dono ke darmiyan koi fazl nahi, ye hamare Nabi ka hum se ahad hai aur hamara tum se ahad hai."
"1320","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein apne dada Aamir ke bete Abi Aamir Malik se khabar pahunchi ke Affan ke bete Usman ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya ke dinar ko do dinar se aur na dirham ko do dirham se becho."
"1321","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Zaid bin Aslam se, unhon ne Yasar ke bete Ata se riwayat kya ke Sufyan ke bete Abi Sufyan Muawiya ne sone ya chandi ki mashkiza ko us ke wazan se zyada se becha to Darda ke bete Abu Darda ne kaha ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko is jaisa se mana karte suna magar barabar barabar. To Muawiya ne us se kaha ke main is jaisa mein koi harj nahi samajhta. To Darda ke bete Abu Darda ne kaha ke mujhe Muawiya se kaun uzr dega, main use Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se khabar deta hun aur wo mujhe apni rai se khabar deta hai, main tumhare sath us sarzameen mein na rahunga jismein tum ho. Phir Darda ke bete Abu Darda Umar bin Khattab ke paas aae aur un se is ka zikr kya to Umar bin Khattab ne Muawiya ko likha ke use na becho magar barabar barabar, wazan se wazan."
"1322","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab ne kaha ke sona sone se na becho magar barabar barabar aur baaz ko baaz par zyada na karo, aur chandi ko chandi se na becho magar barabar barabar aur baaz ko baaz par zyada na karo, aur chandi ko sone se na becho jabke aik ghaib ho aur dusra hazir, aur agar wo tum se mohlat mange yahan tak ke apne ghar mein dakhil ho to use mohlat na do, main tum par rama se darta hun aur rama sood hai."
"1323","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Dinar ke bete Abdullah se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab ne kaha ke sona sone se na becho magar barabar barabar aur baaz ko baaz par zyada na karo, aur chandi ko chandi se na becho magar barabar barabar aur baaz ko baaz par zyada na karo, aur is mein se koi cheez ghaib ko hazir se na becho. Aur agar wo tum se mohlat mange yahan tak ke apne ghar mein dakhil ho to use mohlat na do, main tum par rama se darta hun aur rama sood hai."
"1324","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein Muhammad ke bete Qasim se khabar pahunchi ke unhon ne kaha ke Umar bin Khattab ne kaha ke dinar dinar se aur dirham dirham se aur sa sa se, aur udhar ko naqd se na becha jae."
"1325","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abu Zinad se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab ko kehte suna ke sood nahi magar sone ya chandi mein ya jo naapa ya taula jae jo khaya ya piya jae."
"1326","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab ko kehte suna ke sone aur chandi ko kaatna zameen mein fasad mein se hai. Malik ne kaha ke koi harj nahi ke mard sona chandi se aur chandi sona se andaze se khareede jab wo kacha sona ya ghadha hua zewar ho, aur gine hue dirham aur gine hue dinar ka muamla ye hai ke kisi ke liye jaiz nahi ke use andaze se khareede yahan tak ke jane aur gine, phir agar use andaze se khareede to dhoka chaha jata hai jab ginti chhori jae aur andaze se khareeda jae, aur ye musalmanon ki baiyon mein se nahi, aur jo taula jata ho kache sone aur zewar mein se use andaze se bechne mein koi harj nahi, aur use andaze se khareedna gandum aur khajoor aur is jaisa khano mein se andaze se beche jane jaisa hai aur is jaisa naapa jata hai to use andaze se khareedne mein koi harj nahi. Malik ne kaha ke jo mushaf ya talwar ya anguthi khareede aur is mein se kisi mein sona ya chandi ho dinaron ya dirhamon se, to jo is mein se khareeda jae aur is mein sona ho dinaron se to us ki qeemat dekhi jae gi, phir agar us ki qeemat do tihai ho aur us mein jo sona hai us ki qeemat tihai ho to ye jaiz hai is mein koi harj nahi jab ye haath se haath ho aur is mein takheer na ho, aur jo is mein se chandi se khareeda jae aur is mein chandi ho us ki qeemat dekhi jae gi, phir agar us ki qeemat do tihai ho aur us mein jo chandi hai us ki qeemat tihai ho to ye jaiz hai is mein koi harj nahi jab ye haath se haath ho, aur hamare nazdeek logon ka muamla hamesha se is par hai."
"1327","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Hadsan Nasri ke bete Aus ke bete Malik se riwayat kya ke us ne sau dinar se sarf talash kya. Unhon ne kaha ke mujhe Ubaidullah ke bete Talha ne bulaya to hum ne baham bhao kya yahan tak ke mujh se sarf kya aur sona liya aur use apne haath mein ulat palat karte rahe phir kaha ke yahan tak ke mera khazanchi Ghaba se mere paas aae. Aur Umar bin Khattab sun rahe hain. To Umar ne kaha ke Allah ki qasam tum is se juda na hoge yahan tak ke is se lo, phir kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke sona chandi se sood hai magar haa haa, aur gandum gandum se sood hai magar haa haa, aur khajoor khajoor se sood hai magar haa haa, aur jau jau se sood hai magar haa haa."
"1328","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Qusait ke bete Abdullah ke bete Yazeed se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab ko sona sone se barabar taulte dekha, wo apna sona tarazu ke aik palde mein dalte aur us ka sathi jo is se barabar tauta hai apna sona dusre palde mein dalta, phir jab tarazu ki sui barabar ho jati to lete aur dete. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek sona sone se aur chandi chandi se barabar taul kar bechne mein hukm hai ke is mein koi harj nahi ke gyarah dinar das dinar se le haath se haath jab dono sone ka wazan barabar ho, aanka aankh se, agarche ginti mein fazl ho, aur dirham bhi is mein dinaron ke manzilay mein hain. Malik ne kaha ke jo sona sone se ya chandi chandi se barabar taule aur dono sonon ke darmiyan misqal ka fazl ho aur wo apne sathi ko us ki qeemat chandi se ya is ke ilawa se de to use na le kyunke ye bura hai aur sood ka zariya hai kyunke jab us ke liye jaiz ho ke misqal ko us ki qeemat se le yahan tak ke goya use alag khareeda to us ke liye jaiz hoga ke misqal ko us ki qeemat se baar baar le taake apne aur apne sathi ke darmiyan ye bai jaiz kare. Malik ne kaha ke agar wo use wo misqal akela beche jis ke sath is ke ilawa kuchh na ho to use us thaman ke daswein se na le jis se use liya taake us ke liye bai jaiz ho, to ye haram ko halal karne aur mana kiye hue hukm ka zariya hai. Malik ne us mard ke bare mein kaha jo mard se barabar taule aur use atiq umda sona de aur is ke sath kacha ghair umda sona milae aur apne sathi se Kufi kata hua sona le jabke wo Kufi logon ke nazdeek makrooh hai aur wo dono use barabar barabar bechein ke ye durust nahi. Malik ne kaha ke is ki tafseer jo is mein se makrooh samjha gaya ke umda sone wala apne umda sone ka fazl us kache mein le jo us ne apne sone ke sath milaya, aur agar us ke sone ka us ke sathi ke sone par fazl na hota to us ka sathi use us ke kache se us ke Kufi sone tak barabar na taulta aur ruka rehta, aur is ki misaal to us mard jaisi hai jo umda ke teen sa ko khareede do sa aur mudd khareab khajoor se, to us se kaha gaya ke ye durust nahi. To us ne khareab ke do sa aur ghatiya ka aik sa banaya taake is se apni bai jaiz kare, to ye durust nahi kyunke umda wala use ghatiya ke aik sa se umda ka aik sa na deta tha lekin us ne use khareab ke fazl ke liye diya, ya ke mard mard se kahe ke mujhe safed ke teen sa becho Shami gandum ke do sa aur nisf se, to wo kehta hai ke ye durust nahi magar barabar barabar. To wo Shami gandum ke do sa aur jau ka aik sa banata hai taake in dono ke darmiyan bai jaiz kare, to ye durust nahi kyunke wo use jau ke aik sa se safed gandum ka aik sa na deta tha agar wo sa akela hota, balke us ne use Shami ke safed par fazl ke liye diya, to ye durust nahi aur ye us jaisa hai jo hum ne kache ka bayan kya. Malik ne kaha ke sone aur chandi aur tamam khane mein se har cheez jo barabar barabar ke siwa na bechi jae use umda pasandeeda jins ke sath napasand ghatiya cheez na milani chahiye taake bai jaiz ho aur is se wo halal kya jae jo is mana kiye hue hukm mein se hai jo durust nahi, jab ye us pasandeeda jins ke sath milaya jae, balke us ka malik chahta hai ke is se jo bechta hai us ki umdagi ka fazl pae aur wo cheez de jo agar akeli deta to us ka sathi use qubool na karta aur is ka irada na karta, balke use is liye qubool karta hai jo is ke sath leta hai apne sathi ke saman ke apne saman par fazl ke liye, to sone aur chandi aur khane mein se kisi cheez ke liye jaiz nahi ke is mein is sifat mein se koi cheez dakhil ho, phir agar ghatiya khane wala chahe ke use ghair se beche to use alag beche aur is ke sath koi cheez na milae to is mein koi harj nahi jab aisa ho."
"1329","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo khana khareede use na beche yahan tak ke use poora le."
"1330","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Dinar ke bete Abdullah se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo khana khareede use na beche yahan tak ke use qabze mein le."
"1331","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke hum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamane mein khana khareedte they to hum par bheja jata jo hamein hukm deta ke use us jagah se muntaqil karein jismein hum ne use khareeda tha dusri jagah ki taraf is se pehle ke use bechein."
"1332","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Hizam ke bete Hakeem ne khana khareeda jis ka Umar bin Khattab ne logon ke liye hukm diya tha to Hakeem ne khana becha is se pehle ke use poora le, to ye Umar bin Khattab tak pahuncha to unhon ne use us par radd kya aur kaha ke khana na becho jo khareeda ho yahan tak ke use poora lo."
"1333","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Hakam ke bete Marwan ke zamane mein Jar ke khane mein se logon ke liye dastawezein niklin to log un dastawezon ko aapas mein bechte they is se pehle ke inhein poora lete, to Sabit ke bete Zaid aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sahaba mein se aik mard Hakam ke bete Marwan ke paas dakhil hue aur kaha ke kya tum sood ki bai halal karte ho aye Marwan. To us ne kaha ke main Allah ki panah mangta hun, ye kya hai. To un dono ne kaha ke ye dastawezein hain jinhein log bechte hain phir inhein bechte hain is se pehle ke inhein poora lein, to Marwan ne pehredar bheje jo inhein talash karte they, inhein logon ke haathon se chheente they aur inhein un ke ghar walon ki taraf lautate they."
"1334","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke aik mard ne muddat tak mard se khana khareedna chaha to wo mard jo use khana bechna chahta tha use bazaar ki taraf le gaya aur use dher dikhane laga aur us se kehta tha ke in mein se kis se tum pasand karte ho ke tumhare liye khareedun. To khareedne wale ne kaha ke kya tum mujhe bechte ho jo tumhare paas nahi. To wo Abdullah bin Umar ke paas aae aur un dono ne un se is ka zikr kya to Abdullah bin Umar ne khareedne wale se kaha ke us se na khareedo jo us ke paas nahi. Aur bechne wale se kaha ke na becho jo tumhare paas nahi."
"1335","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke unhon ne muezzin Abdur Rahman ke bete Jamil ko Saeed bin Musayyab se kehte suna ke main mard hun jo rizqon mein se khareedta hun jo logon ko Jar mein diye jate hain jitna Allah chahe, phir main chahta hun ke zamanat wala khana muddat tak bechun. To Saeed ne us se kaha ke kya tum chahta ho ke inhein un rizqon mein se poora karo jo khareede. To us ne kaha ke haan. To use is se mana kya. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek ijma wala hukm hai jis mein koi ikhtilaf nahi ke jo khana khareede, gandum ya jau ya selt ya makai ya jwar ya qatni danon mein se koi cheez ya jo qatni jaisa ho jo zakat wajib hoti hai ya tamam salan mein se koi cheez, tel aur ghee aur shehed aur sirka aur paneer aur shibriq aur doodh aur is jaisa salan mein se, to khareedne wala is mein se koi cheez na beche yahan tak ke use qabze mein le aur poora le."
"1336","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Abu Zinad se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab aur Yasar ke bete Sulaiman ko mana karte suna ke mard gandum ko sone se muddat tak beche phir sone se khajoor khareede is se pehle ke sona qabze mein le."
"1337","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Farqad ke bete Kaseer se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Hazm ke bete Amr ke bete Muhammad ke bete Abu Bakr se us mard ke bare mein pucha jo mard se khana ko sone se muddat tak beche phir sone se khajoor khareede is se pehle ke sona qabze mein le, to us ne ise makrooh samjha aur is se mana kya. Aur mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se is jaisa riwayat kya. Malik ne kaha ke Saeed bin Musayyab aur Yasar ke bete Sulaiman aur Hazm ke bete Amr ke bete Muhammad ke bete Abu Bakr aur Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab ne is liye mana kya ke mard gandum ko sone se na beche phir mard sone se khajoor khareede is se pehle ke sona qabze mein le apni us bai se jis se us ne gandum khareedi thi, aur jo sone se jo us ne gandum bechi thi muddat tak khajoor khareede apne us bechne wale ke ilawa se jis se us ne gandum bechi thi is se pehle ke sona qabze mein le aur jis se khajoor khareedi use apne qarz khwah par hawala kare jis ne us se gandum bechi thi sone se jo us par hai khajoor ki qeemat mein to is mein koi harj nahi. Malik ne kaha ke maine is ke bare mein ahl-e-ilm mein se aik se zyada se pucha to unhon ne is mein koi harj na samjha."
"1338","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Uqba ke bete Ibrahim se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab se doodh pilane ke bare mein pucha to Saeed ne kaha ke har wo jo do saalon mein ho agarche aik qatra ho wo haram karta hai, aur jo do saalon ke baad ho wo to khana hai jo khata hai. Uqba ke bete Ibrahim ne kaha ke phir maine Zubair ke bete Urwa se pucha to unhon ne is jaisa kaha jo Saeed bin Musayyab ne kaha tha."
"1339","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke koi harj nahi ke mard mard ko bayan kiye hue khane mein maloom qeemat se muayyan muddat tak salaf de jab tak kheti mein na ho jis ki durusti zahir na hui ho ya khajoor mein jis ki durusti zahir na hui ho. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek us ke bare mein hukm hai jo khane mein maloom qeemat se muayyan muddat tak salaf de aur muddat halal ho jae aur khareedne wala bechne wale ke paas jo us ne is se khareeda tha wafa na pae aur use iqala kare to us ke liye jaiz nahi ke is se le magar us ka waraq ya us ka sona ya wo thaman jo use ba-ainihi diya tha, aur wo is thaman se koi cheez na khareede yahan tak ke use is se qabze mein le, aur is ki wajah ye hai ke jab wo us thaman ke ilawa le jo diya tha ya use us khane ke ilawa saman mein phere jo us ne is se khareeda tha to wo khana bechna hai is se pehle ke poora le. Malik ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khana bechne se mana kya hai is se pehle ke poora liya jae. Malik ne kaha ke phir agar khareedar nadim ho aur bechne wale se kahe ke mujhe iqala karo aur tumhein us thaman mein mohlat dunga jo maine tumhein diya tha. To ye durust nahi aur ahl-e-ilm is se mana karte hain, aur is ki wajah ye hai ke jab khareedar ke liye bechne wale par khana halal hua to us ne us se apna haq moakhir kya is par ke use iqala kare, to ye khana bechna tha muddat tak is se pehle ke poora liya jae. Malik ne kaha ke is ki tafseer hai ke khareedar jab muddat halal hui aur khana napasand kya to is se dinar liya muddat tak, aur ye iqala nahi, iqala to hai jab bechne wala aur na khareedne wala is mein zyada kare, phir jab is mein zyadati wajeh ho nasiya se muddat tak ya kisi cheez se jo in dono mein se aik apne sathi par zyada kare ya kisi cheez se jis se in dono mein se aik faida uthae to ye iqala nahi, balke iqala jab wo aisa karein bai ban jati hai, aur iqala aur shirk aur tauliya mein to rukhsat di gayi hai jab tak is mein se kisi mein zyadati ya kami ya nazra dakhil na ho, phir agar zyadati ya kami ya nazra dakhil ho to bai ban jati hai jise bai halal karti hai halal karti hai aur jise bai haram karti hai haram karti hai. Malik ne kaha ke jo Shami gandum mein salaf de to koi harj nahi ke mahmul muddat halal hone ke baad le. Malik ne kaha ke isi tarah jo sinfon mein se sinf mein salaf de to koi harj nahi ke jo salaf diya us se behtar ya kamtar muddat halal hone ke baad le, aur is ki tafseer hai ke mard mahmul gandum mein salaf de to koi harj nahi ke jau ya Shami le, aur agar umda khajoor mein salaf de to koi harj nahi ke saihani ya jame le, aur agar surkh kishmish mein salaf de to koi harj nahi ke siyah le jab ye tamam muddat halal hone ke baad ho jab us ki naap us jaisi ho jo salaf diya tha."
"1340","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Yasar ke bete Sulaiman ne kaha ke Waqqas ke bete Saad bin Abi Waqqas ke gadhe ka chara khatm ho gaya to unhon ne apne ghulam se kaha ke apne ghar walon ki gandum mein se lo aur is se jau khareedo aur is jaisa ke siwa na lo."
"1341","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Yasar ke bete Sulaiman se riwayat kya ke unhon ne unhein khabar di ke Yaghuth ke bete Abd ke bete Aswad ke bete Abdur Rahman ki sawari ka chara khatm ho gaya to unhon ne apne ghulam se kaha ke apne ghar walon ki gandum mein se khana lo aur is se jau khareedo aur is jaisa ke siwa na lo."
"1342","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein Muhammad ke bete Qasim se, Muaiqib Dosi ke bete Ibn Muaiqib se is jaisa khabar pahunchi. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek hukm yehi hai. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek ijma wala hukm hai ke gandum gandum se aur na khajoor khajoor se aur na gandum khajoor se aur na khajoor kishmish se aur na gandum kishmish se aur na tamam khane mein se koi cheez magar haath se haath na bechi jae, phir agar is mein se kisi mein muddat dakhil ho to durust na hogi aur haram hogi, aur tamam salan mein se koi cheez magar haath se haath. Malik ne kaha ke khane aur salan mein se koi cheez jab aik jins se ho do aik se na bechi jae, to gandum ka mudd gandum ke do mudd se aur na khajoor ka mudd khajoor ke do mudd se aur na kishmish ka mudd kishmish ke do mudd se aur na is jaisa danon aur tamam salan mein se jab aik jins se ho na becha jae agarche haath se haath ho, balke ye chandi ke chandi se aur sona sone se manzilay mein hai, is mein se kisi mein fazl halal nahi aur barabar barabar haath se haath ke siwa halal nahi. Malik ne kaha ke jab jo naapa ya taula jae jo khaya ya piya jae mukhtalif ho aur us ka ikhtilaf zahir ho to koi harj nahi ke is mein se do aik se liye jaein haath se haath, aur koi harj nahi ke khajoor ka aik sa gandum ke do sa se aur khajoor ka aik sa kishmish ke do sa se aur gandum ka aik sa ghee ke do sa se liya jae, phir jab is mein se do jinsein mukhtalif hon to koi harj nahi ke is mein se do aik se ya is se zyada se haath se haath hon, phir agar is mein muddat dakhil ho to halal nahi. Malik ne kaha ke gandum ka dher gandum ke dher se halal nahi aur gandum ke dher mein khajoor ke dher se koi harj nahi haath se haath, aur is ki wajah ye hai ke koi harj nahi ke gandum khajoor se andaze se khareedi jae. Malik ne kaha ke khane aur salan mein se har wo jo mukhtalif ho aur us ka ikhtilaf zahir ho to koi harj nahi ke baaz baaz se andaze se khareeda jae haath se haath, phir agar is mein muddat dakhil ho to is mein koi bhalai nahi, aur use andaze se khareedna baaz ko sone aur chandi se andaze se khareedne jaisa hai. Malik ne kaha ke is ki wajah ye hai ke tum gandum ko chandi se andaze se khareedte ho aur khajoor ko sone se andaze se, to ye halal hai is mein koi harj nahi. Malik ne kaha ke jo khane ka dher lagaye aur us ki naap jan chuka ho phir use andaze se beche aur khareedne wale se us ki naap chhupaye to ye durust nahi, phir agar khareedne wala chahe ke wo khana bechne wale par lautae to use lautae jo us ne us ki naap chhupayi aur use dhoka diya, aur isi tarah har wo jis ki naap aur ginti bechne wala janta ho khane aur is ke ilawa mein se phir use andaze se beche aur khareedne wala ye na jane to khareedne wala agar chahe ke use bechne wale par lautae to lautae, aur ahl-e-ilm hamesha se is se mana karte aae hain. Malik ne kaha ke roti mein koi bhalai nahi, tikiya do tikiya se aur na badi chhoti se jab baaz is ka baaz se bada ho, aur jo tehqeeq kare ke barabar barabar ho to is mein koi harj nahi agarche taula na jae. Malik ne kaha ke makkhan ka mudd aur doodh ka mudd makkhan ke do mudd se durust nahi, aur ye us jaisa hai jo hum ne khajoor ka bayan kya jo bechi jati hai khareab ke do sa aur ghatiya ka aik sa umda ke teen sa se jab us ne apne sathi se kaha ke khareab ke do sa umda ke teen sa se durust nahi. To is ne aisa kya taake apni bai jaiz kare, balke doodh wala doodh ko apne makkhan ke sath milata hai taake apne makkhan ka apne sathi ke makkhan par fazl le jab us ke sath doodh dakhil kya. Malik ne kaha ke aata gandum se barabar barabar mein koi harj nahi, aur is ki wajah ye hai ke us ne aata khalis kya aur use gandum se barabar barabar becha, aur agar aade mudd ko aate se aur aadhe ko gandum se banaye aur use gandum ke aik mudd se beche to ye us jaisa hoga jo hum ne bayan kya, durust na hoga kyunke us ne apni achhi gandum ka fazl lena chaha yahan tak ke us ke sath aata milaya, to ye durust nahi."
"1343","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Maryam ke bete Abi Maryam ke bete Abdullah ke bete Muhammad se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab se pucha aur kaha ke main mard hun jo khana khareedta hun jo Jar mein dastawezon mein se hota hai, phir kabhi is mein se dinar aur nisf dirham se khareedta hun aur nisf se khana deta hun. To Saeed ne kaha ke nahi, lekin tum dirham do aur apna baqi khana lo."
"1344","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Sireen ke bete Muhammad kehte they ke dane ko us ki baal mein na becho yahan tak ke safed ho. Malik ne kaha ke jo khana maloom qeemat se muayyan muddat tak khareede phir jab muddat halal ho to jis par khana hai wo apne sathi se kahe ke mere paas khana nahi to mujhe wo khana becho jo tumhara mujh par hai muddat tak. To khane wala kahe ke ye durust nahi kyunke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khana bechne se mana kya hai yahan tak ke poora liya jae. To jis par khana hai wo apne qarz khwah se kahe ke mujhe muddat tak khana becho yahan tak ke tumhein ada karun. To ye durust nahi kyunke wo use khana deta hai phir use us ki taraf lautata hai. To wo sona jo us ne diya us ki qeemat ban jata hai jo us ke liye us par tha, aur wo khana jo us ne diya in dono ke darmiyan halal karne wala ban jata hai, aur ye jab wo dono aisa karein khana bechna hoga is se pehle ke poora liya jae. Malik ne us mard ke bare mein kaha jis ke liye mard par khana ho jo us ne is se khareeda tha aur us ke qarz khwah ke liye mard par us khane jaisa khana ho, to jis par khana hai wo apne qarz khwah se kahe ke main tumhein apne qarz khwah par hawala karta hun jis par us khane jaisa hai jo tumhara mujh par hai tumhare us khane se jo tumhara mujh par hai. Malik ne kaha ke agar jis par khana hai wo to khana hai jo us ne khareeda tha aur wo chahta hai ke apne qarz khwah ko khareede hue khane se hawala kare to ye durust nahi, aur ye khana bechna hai is se pehle ke poora liya jae, phir agar khana hal salaf ho to koi harj nahi ke is se apne qarz khwah ko hawala kare kyunke ye bai nahi, aur khana bechna is se pehle ke poora liya jae halal nahi kyunke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is se mana kya hai, siwae is ke ke ahl-e-ilm ijma kar chuke hain ke khane aur is ke ilawa mein shirk aur tauliya aur iqala mein koi harj nahi. Malik ne kaha ke is ki wajah ye hai ke ahl-e-ilm ne use maroof ke taur par utara aur bai ke taur par na utara, aur ye us mard jaisa hai jo naqis dirham salaf de aur wazni dirham ada kiye jaein jin mein fazl ho, to us ke liye ye halal hoga aur jaiz hoga, aur agar us se naqis dirham wazni se khareede to ye halal na hoga, aur agar us par shart rakhe jab use salaf de ke wazni jabke us ne use naqis diye to us ke liye ye halal na hoga. Malik ne kaha ke is jaisa hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne muzabana ki bai se mana kya aur khajoor mein se araya ki bai mein apne andaze se rukhsat di, aur in dono ke darmiyan farq is liye kya ke muzabana ki bai muqaisa aur tijarat ke taur par bai hai aur araya ki bai maroof ke taur par hai is mein muqaisa nahi. Malik ne kaha ke jaiz nahi ke mard khana chauthai ya tihai ya dirham ke tukde se khareede is par ke use is se muddat tak khana diya jae, aur koi harj nahi ke mard khana dirham ke tukde se muddat tak khareede phir dirham de aur jo us ke dirham se baqi ho us se saman mein se saman le kyunke us ne jo tukda us par tha chandi di aur apne baqi dirham se saman liya, to is mein koi harj nahi. Malik ne kaha ke koi harj nahi ke mard mard ke paas dirham rakhe phir is se chauthai ya tihai ya maloom tukde se maloom saman le, phir jab is mein maloom qeemat na ho aur mard kahe ke tum se har din ki qeemat se lunga to ye halal nahi kyunke ye dhoka hai jo kabhi kam hota hai aur kabhi zyada hota hai, aur wo maloom bai par juda na hue. Malik ne kaha ke jo khana andaze se beche aur is mein se koi cheez mustasna na kare phir us ke liye zahir ho ke is mein se koi cheez khareede to us ke liye durust nahi ke is mein se koi cheez khareede magar jo us ke liye jaiz tha ke is mein se mustasna kare, aur wo tihai aur is se kam hai, phir agar tihai se zyada ho to ye muzabana ki taraf aur jo makrooh hai us ki taraf ho gaya, to us ke liye jaiz nahi ke is mein se koi cheez khareede magar jo us ke liye jaiz tha ke is mein se mustasna kare, aur us ke liye jaiz nahi ke is mein se mustasna kare magar tihai aur is se kam, aur ye wo hukm hai jis mein hamare nazdeek koi ikhtilaf nahi."
"1345","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Umar bin Khattab ne kaha ke hamare bazaar mein zakheera na karo, mard apne haathon se Allah ke rizq mein se jo rizq hamare sehan mein utra us ke fazil sone se irada na karein aur use hum par zakheera karein, lekin jo laane wala apne kaleje ke sutun par sardiyon aur garmiyon mein lae to wo Umar ka mehmaan hai, to beche jaisa Allah chahe aur roke jaisa Allah chahe."
"1346","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yusuf ke bete Yunus se, unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab Balta ke bete Hatib ke paas se guzre jabke wo bazaar mein apni kishmish bech rahe they to Umar bin Khattab ne us se kaha ke ya to qeemat mein zyada karo ya hamare bazaar se uth jao."
"1347","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Affan ke bete Usman zakheera se mana karte they."
"1348","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Kaisan ke bete Saleh se, unhon ne Talib ke bete Ali ke bete Muhammad ke bete Hasan se riwayat kya ke Talib ke bete Ali bin Abi Talib ne apna oont jise Usfair kaha jata hai bees oonton se muddat tak becha."
"1349","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar ne sawari chaar oonton se khareedi jo us par zamanat they, inhein us ka malik Rabaza mein poora kare."
"1350","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se janwar ki bai ke bare mein pucha, do aik se muddat tak, to unhon ne kaha ke is mein koi harj nahi. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek ijma wala hukm hai ke oont ko us jaisa oont se aur dirham zyada se haath se haath mein koi harj nahi, aur oont ko us jaisa oont se aur dirham zyada se, oont oont se haath se haath aur dirham muddat tak, mein koi harj nahi. Unhon ne kaha ke oont ko us jaisa oont se aur dirham zyada mein, dirham naqd aur oont muddat tak, mein koi bhalai nahi, aur agar oont aur dirham moakhir karein to is mein bhi koi bhalai nahi. Malik ne kaha ke koi harj nahi ke najeeb oont ko do oonton ya oonton se bojh uthane wale oonton ke rewaj se khareede agarche aik maal mein se hon, to is mein se do aik se muddat tak khareedne mein koi harj nahi jab mukhtalif hon aur un ka ikhtilaf zahir ho, aur agar baaz is ka baaz se milta julta ho aur un ki jinsein mukhtalif hon ya mukhtalif na hon to is mein se do aik se muddat tak na liye jaein. Malik ne kaha ke is ki tafseer jo is mein se makrooh samjha gaya ke oont ko do oonton se liya jae jabke in dono ke darmiyan najabat aur sawari mein fazl na ho, phir jab ye jo maine tumhein bayan kya us par ho to is mein se do aik se muddat tak na khareede jaein, aur koi harj nahi ke jo is mein se khareede use qabze se pehle beche us ke ilawa se jis se use khareeda tha jab apni qeemat wasool kare. Malik ne kaha ke jo janwar mein se kisi cheez mein muayyan muddat tak salaf de aur us ka wasf aur huliya bayan kare aur us ki qeemat naqd de to ye jaiz hai aur ye bechne wale aur khareedne wale par lazim hai jo unhon ne wasf aur huliya bayan kya, aur ye hamesha se logon ke jaiz amal mein se hai aur jis par hamare shehar ke ahl-e-ilm hamesha se hain."
"1351","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne habal-ul-habla ki bai se mana kya. Aur ye bai thi jo ahl-e-Jahiliya aapas mein karte they, mard jazoor ko khareedta tha yahan tak ke oontni bacha jane. Phir wo jane jo us ke pet mein hai."
"1352","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke janwar mein sood nahi, janwar mein se to teen se mana kya gaya hai, mazameen aur malaqeeh aur habal-ul-habla se. Aur mazameen oontniyon ke peton mein jo hai us ki bai hai aur malaqeeh oonton ki peethon mein jo hai us ki bai hai. Malik ne kaha ke kisi ke liye jaiz nahi ke janwar mein se ba-ainihi koi cheez khareede jab wo is se ghaib ho agarche use dekh chuka ho aur use pasand kar chuka ho, is par ke us ki qeemat naqd de, na qareeb aur na door. Malik ne kaha ke is ko is liye makrooh samjha kyunke bechne wala qeemat se faida uthata hai aur nahi maloom ke wo saman us par hai jo khareedne wale ne use dekha tha ya nahi, is liye is ko makrooh samjha, aur is mein koi harj nahi jab zamanat wala bayan kiya hua ho."
"1353","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Zaid bin Aslam se, unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah."
"1354","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Husain ke bete Dawood se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab ko kehte suna ke ahl-e-Jahiliya ke juwe mein se janwar ki bai hai gosht se, bakri aur do bakriyon se."
"1355","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abu Zinad se, unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab se riwayat kya ke wo kehte they ke janwar ki bai se mana kya gaya gosht se. Abu Zinad ne kaha ke maine Saeed bin Musayyab se kaha ke batao mard ne budhi oontni ko das bakriyon se khareeda. To Saeed ne kaha ke agar us ne use zibah karne ke liye khareeda to is mein koi bhalai nahi. Abu Zinad ne kaha ke har wo jise maine logon mein se paya janwar ki bai se gosht se mana karte hain. Abu Zinad ne kaha ke ye Usman ke bete Aban aur Ismail ke bete Hisham ke zamane mein aamilon ke ehednamon mein likha jata tha ke is se mana karte they."
"1356","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Haris ke bete Hisham ke bete Abdur Rahman ke bete Abu Bakr se, unhon ne Ansari Abu Masud se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kutte ki qeemat aur fahisha ki ujrat aur kahin ke tohfe se mana kya. Yani fahisha ki ujrat se jo aurat ko zina par diya jae aur kahin ka tohfa us ki rishwat hai aur jo kahanat par diya jae."
"1357","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bai aur salaf se mana kya. Malik ne kaha ke is ki tafseer hai ke mard mard se kahe ke tumhara saman itna itna lekar is par ke mujhe itna itna salaf do. Phir agar wo dono apni bai is par baandhein to ye jaiz nahi, phir agar wo jis ne salaf ki shart rakhi thi jo us ne is mein se shart rakha tha chhor de to ye bai jaiz hogi. Malik ne kaha ke koi harj nahi ke kataan ya Shati ya Qasbi kapda Atribi ya Qussi ya Zaiqa ke kapdon se ya Harwi ya Marwi kapda Yamani chadron aur Shaqaiq aur is jaisa se aik do ya teen se khareede haath se haath ya muddat tak, aur agar aik jins se ho aur is mein nasiya dakhil ho to is mein koi bhalai nahi. Malik ne kaha ke durust na hogi yahan tak ke mukhtalif ho aur us ka ikhtilaf zahir ho, phir jab baaz is ka baaz se milta julta ho agarche us ke naam mukhtalif hon to is mein se do aik se muddat tak na le, aur ye is tarah ke Harwi ke do kapde Marwi ya Quhi ke kapde se muddat tak le ya Farqubi ke do kapde Shati ke kapde se le, phir jab ye ajnaas is sifat par hon to is mein se do aik se muddat tak na khareede jaein. Malik ne kaha ke koi harj nahi ke jo is mein se khareede use qabze se pehle beche apne us sathi ke ilawa se jis se use khareeda tha jab apni qeemat wasool kare."
"1358","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Muhammad ke bete Qasim se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke maine Abdullah bin Abbas ko suna jabke aik mard un se us mard ke bare mein puchh raha tha jis ne sabab mein salaf diya aur use qabze se pehle bechna chahta tha, to Ibn Abbas ne kaha ke ye chandi se chandi hai. Aur ise makrooh samjha. Malik ne kaha ke ye hamare khayal mein, wallahu alam, is liye hai ke us ne irada kya ke use apne us sathi se beche jis se use khareeda tha us thaman se zyada se jis se use khareeda tha, aur agar wo use us ke ilawa se beche jis se use khareeda tha to is mein koi harj na hoga. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek ijma wala hukm hai ke jo ghulamon ya maweshiyon ya saman mein salaf de aur har cheez is mein se bayan ki hui ho aur is mein muddat tak salaf de aur muddat halal ho jae to khareedar is mein se koi cheez us se na beche jis se use khareeda tha us thaman se zyada se jo is mein salaf diya tha is se pehle ke jo salaf diya tha qabze mein le, aur is ki wajah ye hai ke jab wo aisa kare to ye sood hai, khareedar hua ke jis ne use becha use dinar ya dirham diye aur wo is se faida uthaya, phir jab us par saman halal hua aur khareedar ne use qabza na kya to use apne sathi se us se zyada se becha jo is mein salaf diya tha, to hua ke use jo salaf diya tha lautaya aur apne paas se zyada diya. Malik ne kaha ke jo sona ya chandi janwar ya saman mein salaf de jab bayan kiya hua ho muayyan muddat tak phir muddat halal ho to koi harj nahi ke khareedar wo saman bechne wale se muddat halal hone se pehle ya halal hone ke baad saman mein se saman se beche jo jald de aur moakhir na kare, chahe wo saman jahan tak pahunche, magar khana kyunke use halal nahi ke beche yahan tak ke use qabze mein le, aur khareedar ke liye hai ke wo saman apne us sathi ke ilawa se beche jis se use khareeda tha sone ya chandi ya saman mein se saman se jo qabze mein le aur moakhir na kare kyunke jab wo moakhir kare to bura hoga aur is mein wo dakhil hoga jo kali se kali mein makrooh hai, aur kali se kali hai ke mard apna qarz jo mard par hai dusre mard par qarz se beche. Malik ne kaha ke jo saman mein muddat tak salaf de aur wo saman jo khaya aur na piya jae to khareedar use jis se chahe naqd ya saman se beche is se pehle ke use poora le apne us sathi ke ilawa se jis se use khareeda tha, aur us ke liye jaiz nahi ke use us se beche jis se use khareeda tha magar saman se jo qabze mein le aur moakhir na kare. Malik ne kaha ke agar saman halal na hua ho to koi harj nahi ke use apne sathi se us se mukhalif saman se beche jis ka ikhtilaf zahir ho jo qabze mein le aur moakhir na kare. Malik ne us ke bare mein kaha jo dinar ya dirham chaar bayan kiye hue kapdon mein muddat tak salaf de, phir jab muddat halal ho to us ke malik se taqaza kare aur use us ke paas na pae aur us ke paas us ki jins se kamtar kapde pae, to jis par kapde hain wo us se kahe ke main tumhein in ke badle apne in kapdon se aath kapde dunga. Ke is mein koi harj nahi jab wo kapde jo use deta hai juda hone se pehle le, phir agar is mein muddat dakhil ho to durust na hoga, aur agar ye muddat halal hone se pehle ho to bhi durust na hoga magar ke use aise kapde beche jo un kapdon ki jins se na hon jin mein us ne use salaf diya tha."
"1359","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik bai mein do baion se mana kya."
"1360","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke aik mard ne mard se kaha ke mere liye ye oont naqd khareedo yahan tak ke main use tum se muddat tak khareedun, to is ke bare mein Abdullah bin Umar se pucha gaya to unhon ne ise makrooh samjha aur is se mana kya."
"1361","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Muhammad ke bete Qasim se us mard ke bare mein pucha gaya jis ne saman ko das dinar naqd ya pandrah dinar muddat tak khareeda to unhon ne ise makrooh samjha aur is se mana kya. Malik ne us mard ke bare mein kaha jo mard se saman ko das dinar naqd ya pandrah dinar muddat tak khareede jab khareedar ke liye dono qeematon mein se aik wajib ho chuki ho ke ye jaiz nahi kyunke agar das ko moakhir kare to pandrah muddat tak hongi, aur agar das ko naqd de to us ne is se un pandrah ko khareeda jo muddat tak hain. Malik ne us mard ke bare mein kaha jo mard se saman ko dinar naqd ya bayan ki hui bakri muddat tak khareede jab us par dono qeematon mein se aik wajib ho chuki ho ke ye makrooh hai jaiz nahi kyunke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik bai mein do baion se mana kya hai aur ye aik bai mein do baion mein se hai. Malik ne us mard ke bare mein kaha jo mard se kahe ke tum se ye umda pandrah sa ya saihani das sa ya mahmul gandum pandrah sa ya Shami das sa dinar se khareedta hun jab mere liye in dono mein se aik wajib ho chuki ho ke ye makrooh hai halal nahi, aur is ki wajah ye hai ke us ke liye saihani ke das sa wajib ho chuke hain to wo inhein chhorta hai aur umda ke pandrah sa leta hai, ya us par mahmul gandum ke pandrah sa wajib hote hain to inhein chhorta hai aur Shami ke das sa leta hai, to ye bhi makrooh hai halal nahi, aur ye bhi us jaisa hai jo aik bai mein do baion mein mana kya gaya, aur ye bhi us mein se hai jo mana kya gaya ke khane ke aik jins mein se do aik se becha jae."
"1362","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Dinar ke bete Abu Hazim se, unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dhoke ki bai se mana kya. Malik ne kaha ke dhoke aur khatre mein se hai ke mard irada kare jis ki sawari gum ho gayi ho ya us ka ghulam bhag gaya ho aur is mein se cheez ki qeemat pachaas dinar ho aur mard kahe ke main use tum se bees dinar mein lunga. Phir agar khareedne wala use pa le to bechne wale se tees dinar gae, aur agar use na pae to bechne wala khareedne wale se bees dinar le gaya. Malik ne kaha ke is mein dusra aib hai ke wo gumi agar pai gayi to maloom nahi ke badhi ya ghati ya is mein aibon mein se kya paida hua, to ye sab se bada khatra hai. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek hukm hai ke khatre aur dhoke mein se auraton aur janwaron ke peton mein jo hai us ka khareedna hai kyunke nahi maloom ke niklega ya nahi niklega, phir agar nikle to maloom nahi ke khubsurat hoga ya badsurat ya mukammal ya naqis ya narr ya mada, aur ye tamam tafawut rakhta hai ke agar aisa ho to us ki qeemat aisi aur agar aisa ho to us ki qeemat aisi. Malik ne kaha ke madon ko bechna aur un ke peton mein jo hai use mustasna karna jaiz nahi, aur ye is tarah ke mard mard se kahe ke meri doodh wali bakri ki qeemat teen dinar hai to wo tumhare liye do dinar se hai aur jo us ke pet mein hai wo mere liye. To ye makrooh hai kyunke dhoka aur khatra hai. Malik ne kaha ke zaitun ko tel se aur til ko til ke tel se aur makkhan ko ghee se bechna halal nahi kyunke muzabana is mein dakhil hai aur kyunke jo dana aur is jaisa us mein se nikalne wali naam li hui cheez se khareedta hai nahi maloom ke is mein se us se kam niklega ya zyada, to ye dhoka aur khatra hai. Malik ne kaha ke is mein se ye bhi hai ke ban ke beejon ko saleekha se khareedna, to ye dhoka hai kyunke jo ban ke beejon se nikalta hai wo saleekha hai, aur ban ke beejon mein khushbudaar ban se koi harj nahi kyunke khushbudaar ban khushbudaar kya gaya aur sookh gaya aur saleekha ki halat se badal gaya. Malik ne us mard ke bare mein kaha jo mard se saman beche is par ke khareedne wale par koi nuqsan nahi ke ye na-jaiz bai hai aur ye khatre mein se hai, aur is ki tafseer hai ke goya us ne use nafa par ujrat par rakha agar us saman mein ho, aur agar raas maal par ya nuqsan par beche to us ke liye kuchh nahi aur us ki mehnat batil gayi, to ye durust nahi, aur khareedne wale ke liye is mein ujrat hai jo us ne is mein ilaj kya aur jo us saman mein nuqsan ya nafa se ho wo bechne wale ke liye hai aur us par, aur ye tab hota hai jab saman faut ho jae aur becha jae. Phir agar faut na ho to in dono ke darmiyan bai faskh ki jae. Malik ne kaha ke jo mard mard se saman beche aur us ki bai pakki kare phir khareedar nadim ho aur bechne wale se kahe ke mujh se kam karo aur bechne wala inkar kare aur kahe ke becho to tum par koi nuqsan nahi. To is mein koi harj nahi kyunke ye khatre mein se nahi, balke ye wo cheez hai jo us ke liye kam ki aur in dono ki bai is par baandhi na gayi thi, aur yehi wo hai jis par hamare nazdeek hukm hai."
"1363","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Habban ke bete Muhammad bin Yahya se aur Abu Zinad se, unhon ne Araj se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mulamasa aur munabaza se mana kya."
"1364","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke bai karne wale dono mein se har aik ko apne sathi par ikhtiyar hai jab tak juda na hon magar khiyar wali bai."
"1365","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Masud ke bete Abdullah bin Masud bayan karte they ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab do bai karne wale bai karein to qaul wo hai jo bechne wala kahe ya wo dono lauta dein."
"1366","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Abu Zinad se, unhon ne Saeed ke bete Busr se, unhon ne Safah ke azad karda Saleh ke bete Abi Saleh Ubaid se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke maine apna kapda Dar Nakhla walon se muddat tak becha phir maine Kufa ki taraf nikalne ka irada kya to unhon ne mujh par pesh kya ke main un se baaz qeemat kam karun aur wo mujhe naqd dein, to maine is ke bare mein Sabit ke bete Zaid se pucha to unhon ne kaha ke main tumhein hukm nahi deta ke ye khao aur na ke khilao."
"1367","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Khalda ke bete Hafs ke bete Usman se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Abdullah ke bete Salim se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke un se us mard ke bare mein pucha gaya jis ka mard par muddat tak qarz ho aur haq wala is se kam kare aur dusra use jald de, to Abdullah bin Umar ne ise makrooh samjha aur is se mana kya."
"1368","Mujhe Malik ne Zaid bin Aslam se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Jahiliya mein sood ye tha ke mard ka mard par muddat tak haq hota, phir jab muddat halal hoti to kehta ke kya tum ada karte ho ya zyada karte ho, phir agar ada karta to leta warna us ke haq mein zyada karta aur us se muddat mein takheer karta. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek makrooh hukm jis mein koi ikhtilaf nahi ke mard ka mard par muddat tak qarz ho aur talab karne wala is se kam kare aur jis se manga gaya ho use jald de, aur ye hamare nazdeek us ke manzilay mein hai jo apna qarz apne qarz khwah se us ke halal hone ke baad moakhir kare aur qarz khwah us ke haq mein zyada kare. Unhon ne kaha ke ye ain sood hai is mein koi shak nahi. Malik ne us mard ke bare mein kaha jis ka mard par sau dinar muddat tak hon, phir jab halal hon to jis par qarz hai wo us se kahe ke mujhe saman becho jis ki qeemat sau dinar naqd ho derh sau muddat tak, ye bai durust nahi aur ahl-e-ilm hamesha se is se mana karte aae hain. Malik ne kaha ke is ko is liye makrooh samjha kyunke wo use us ki jo becha ba-ainihi qeemat deta hai aur us se pehli sau ko us muddat tak moakhir karta hai jo us ne us se aakhri martaba zikr ki aur us par us se takheer mein pachaas dinar zyada karta hai, to ye makrooh hai durust nahi, aur ye bhi Zaid bin Aslam ki ahl-e-Jahiliya ki bai ki hadis jaisa hai ke wo jab un ke qarz halal hote to jis par qarz hota us se kehte ke ya to ada karo ya zyada karo. Phir agar ada karta to lete warna un ke huqooq mein zyada karte aur unhein muddat mein zyada dete."
"1369","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Abu Zinad se, unhon ne Araj se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ghani ka talna zulm hai aur jab tum mein se kisi ko khushhaal par hawala kya jae to hawala qubool kare."
"1370","Mujhe Malik ne Maisara ke bete Musa se riwayat kya ke unhon ne aik mard ko Saeed bin Musayyab se puchte suna to us ne kaha ke main mard hun jo udhar se bechta hun. To Saeed ne kaha ke na becho magar jo apne rehle mein sameto. Malik ne us ke bare mein kaha jo mard se saman khareede is par ke use wo saman muayyan muddat tak poora kare, ya to bazaar ke liye jis mein us ki khapat ki umeed rakhta ho ya us zamane mein haajat ke liye jis ki us par shart rakhi, phir bechne wala use us muddat se khilaf kare aur khareedar us saman ko bechne wale par radd karna chahe ke ye khareedar ke liye nahi aur bai us par lazim hai, aur bechne wala agar wo saman muddat halal hone se pehle le aae to khareedar ko use lene par majboor na kya jaega. Malik ne us ke bare mein kaha jo khana khareede aur use naape phir us ke paas wo aae jo us se use khareede aur jo us ke paas aae use khabar de ke us ne use apne liye naapa hai aur poora liya hai aur khareedar chahe ke use sach mane aur use us ki naap se le ke jo is sifat par naqd becha gaya is mein koi harj nahi, aur jo is sifat par muddat tak becha gaya wo makrooh hai yahan tak ke dusra khareedar use apne liye naape, aur muddat wale ko is liye makrooh samjha kyunke ye sood ka zariya hai aur darr hai ke use is taur par baghair naap aur wazan ke ghumaya jae, phir agar muddat tak ho to makrooh hai aur hamare nazdeek is mein koi ikhtilaf nahi. Malik ne kaha ke ghaib ya hazir mard par qarz na khareeda jae magar us ke iqrar se jis par qarz hai, aur na murde par agarche jane jo murda chhor gaya, aur is ki wajah ye hai ke is ka khareedna dhoka hai, nahi maloom ke poora hota hai ya nahi hota. Unhon ne kaha ke is ki tafseer jo is mein se makrooh samjha gaya ke jab ghaib ya murde par qarz khareede to nahi maloom ke murde ko wo qarz kya laheq hota hai jo maloom na tha, phir agar murde ko qarz laheq ho to jo thaman khareedne wale ne diya batil gaya. Malik ne kaha ke is mein dusra aib hai ke us ne aisi cheez khareedi jo us ke liye zamanat wali nahi, aur agar poori na ho to us ka thaman batil gaya, to ye dhoka hai durust nahi. Malik ne kaha ke is mein farq is liye kya ke mard na beche magar jo us ke paas ho aur mard salaf de us mein jo us ke paas nahi, asal ye hai ke eena wala to apna sona uthata hai jis se khareedna chahta hai aur kehta hai ke ye das dinar hain to tum kya chahte ho ke tumhare liye is se khareedun, to goya wo das dinar naqd ko pandrah dinar muddat tak bechta hai, is liye is ko makrooh samjha, aur ye to dakhla aur dhoka hai."
"1371","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Haris ke bete Hisham ke bete Abdur Rahman ke bete Abu Bakr se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo mard saman beche aur jo us se khareede wo muflis ho jae aur jis ne becha us ne us ki qeemat mein se kuchh qabza na kya ho aur use ba-ainihi pae to wo is ka zyada haqdar hai, aur agar jo use khareede wo mar jae to saman wala is mein qarz khwahon ke barabar hai."
"1372","Mujhe Malik ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Hazm ke bete Amr ke bete Muhammad ke bete Abu Bakr se, unhon ne Umar bin Abdul Aziz se, unhon ne Haris ke bete Hisham ke bete Abdur Rahman ke bete Abu Bakr se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo mard muflis ho aur mard apna maal ba-ainihi pa le to wo is ka ghair se zyada haqdar hai."
"1373","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Zaid bin Aslam se, unhon ne Yasar ke bete Ata se, unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke azad karda Abu Rafi se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jawan oont salaf liya phir Aap ke paas sadqe mein se oont aae. Abu Rafi ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhe hukm diya ke mard ko us ka jawan oont ada karun to maine kaha ke maine oonton mein umda chaupaya ke siwa na paya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke use use do kyunke logon mein behtar wo hain jo ada karne mein behtar hon."
"1374","Mujhe Malik ne Makki Qais ke bete Humaid se, unhon ne Mujahid se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Abdullah bin Umar ne mard se dirham salaf liye phir use is se behtar dirham ada kiye to mard ne kaha ke aye Abu Abdur Rahman ye mere dirhamon se behtar hain jo maine tumhein salaf diye they. To Abdullah bin Umar ne kaha ke main jan chuka hun lekin mera nafs is se khush hai. Malik ne kaha ke koi harj nahi ke jo salaf de sona ya chandi ya khana ya janwar mein se koi cheez us se le jis ne use salaf diya tha jo salaf diya tha us se afzal, jab ye in dono mein se shart ya aadat par na ho, phir agar ye shart ya wada ya aadat par ho to makrooh hai is mein koi bhalai nahi. Unhon ne kaha ke is ki wajah ye hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne umda chaupaya salaf liye hue jawan oont ki jagah ada kya aur Abdullah bin Umar ne dirham salaf liye aur is se behtar ada kiye, phir agar ye salaf lene wale ki khush dili par ho aur shart aur na wada aur na aadat par ho to halal hoga is mein koi harj nahi."
"1375","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Umar bin Khattab ne us mard ke bare mein kaha jo mard ko khana salaf de is par ke use use dusre shehar mein de, to Umar bin Khattab ne ise makrooh samjha aur kaha ke bojh kahan hai, yani us ka uthana."
"1376","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke aik mard Abdullah bin Umar ke paas aaya aur kaha ke aye Abu Abdur Rahman maine mard ko salaf diya aur us par shart rakhi ke jo maine use salaf diya us se behtar. To Abdullah bin Umar ne kaha ke ye sood hai. Unhon ne kaha ke aye Abu Abdur Rahman tum mujhe kya hukm dete ho. To Abdullah ne kaha ke salaf teen taur par hai, salaf jo salaf do aur is se Allah ka chehra chaho to tumhare liye Allah ka chehra hai, aur salaf jo salaf do aur is se apne sathi ka chehra chaho to tumhare liye apne sathi ka chehra hai, aur salaf jo salaf do taake khabees ko umda se lo to ye sood hai. Unhon ne kaha ke aye Abu Abdur Rahman tum mujhe kya hukm dete ho. Unhon ne kaha ke meri rai hai ke saheefa phaad do, phir agar tumhein jo salaf diya tha us jaisa de to qubool karo, aur agar tumhein jo salaf diya tha us se kam de to use lo ajr paoge, aur agar tumhein jo salaf diya tha us se behtar de jabke us ka nafs is se khush ho to ye shukr hai jo us ne tumhara ada kya aur tumhare liye us ka ajr hai jo tum ne use mohlat di."
"1377","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar ko kehte suna ke jo salaf de wo ada ke siwa shart na rakhe."
"1378","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Masud ke bete Abdullah bin Masud kehte they ke jo salaf de wo is se behtar ki shart na rakhe agarche chara ki mutthi ho to ye sood hai. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek ijma wala hukm hai ke jo janwar mein se koi cheez maloom sifat aur huliye se mustarad le wo durust hai aur us par hai ke us jaisa lautae, magar bachon waliyon mein se, kyunke is mein us ko halal karne ka zariya hone ka darr hai jo halal nahi, to durust nahi, aur is ki tafseer jo is mein se makrooh samjha gaya ke mard londi ko mustarad le aur use pahunche jab tak chahe phir use us ke malik ko ba-ainihi lautae, to ye durust nahi aur halal nahi, aur ahl-e-ilm hamesha se is se mana karte aae hain aur kisi ke liye is mein rukhsat nahi dete."
"1379","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum mein se koi baaz ki bai par baaz na beche."
"1380","Mujhe Malik ne Abu Zinad se, unhon ne Araj se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aane wale sawaron ko bai ke liye na milo aur tum mein se koi baaz ki bai par baaz na beche aur na najsh karo aur na shehri dehati ke liye beche aur na oontniyon aur bakriyon ke thanon mein doodh roko, phir jo is ke baad inhein khareede to use dohnne ke baad do nazron mein behtar ka ikhtiyar hai, agar use pasand kare to roke aur agar napasand kare to lautae aur khajoor ka aik sa."
"1381","Malik ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne najsh se mana kya."
"1382","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Dinar ke bete Abdullah se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke aik mard ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se zikr kya ke use baion mein dhoka diya jata hai to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab bai karo to kaho ke dhoka nahi. Unhon ne kaha ke wo mard jab bai karta to kehta ke dhoka nahi."
"1383","Mujhe Malik ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab ko kehte suna ke jab aisi sarzameen mein aao jo naap tol poora karte hon to qiyam lamba karo, aur jab aisi sarzameen mein aao jo naap tol mein kami karte hon to qiyam kam karo."
"1384","Mujhe Malik ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Munkadar ke bete Muhammad ko kehte suna ke Allah bande ko pasand karta hai jo bechne mein narm ho, khareedne mein narm ho, ada karne mein narm ho, taqaza karne mein narm ho. Malik ne us mard ke bare mein kaha jo oont ya bakriyan ya kapda ya ghulam ya saman mein se koi cheez andaze se khareede ke andaza us cheez mein na hoga jo ginti se gini jae. Malik ne us mard ke bare mein kaha jo mard ko saman de taake use us ke liye beche jabke us ke malik ne us ki qeemat lagai ho aur kaha ho ke agar use is qeemat se becho jis ka maine tumhein hukm diya hai to tumhare liye dinar hai, ya koi cheez jo us ke liye naam le jis par wo dono razi hon, aur agar use na becho to tumhare liye kuchh nahi, ke is mein koi harj nahi jab qeemat naam le jis se beche aur maloom ujrat naam le jo bechne par le, aur agar na beche to us ke liye kuchh nahi. Malik ne kaha ke is jaisa hai ke mard mard se kahe ke agar mere bhage hue ghulam par qadir ho ya mera gumshuda oont lekar aao to tumhare liye itna hai. To ye joal ke darwaze mein se hai ijare ke darwaze mein se nahi, aur agar ijare ke darwaze mein se hota to durust na hota. Malik ne kaha ke jo mard ko saman diya jae aur us se kaha jae ke use becho aur tumhare liye har dinar mein itna itna hai. Naam lekar jo naam le to ye durust nahi kyunke jab saman ki qeemat se aik dinar kam ho to us ke haq mein se jo us ke liye naam liya tha kam hoga, to ye dhoka hai, nahi maloom ke us ke liye joal kitna hai."
"1385","Mujhe Malik ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se riwayat kya ke unhon ne un se us mard ke bare mein pucha jo sawari kiraye par le phir use us se zyada par kiraye par de jis par use kiraye par liya tha. To unhon ne kaha ke is mein koi harj nahi."


